[gd_scene load_steps=6 format=3]

; Dust in the air (plan 2.11): the first particles in the project. A few dozen
; slow motes hang in the lamp's light over the desk and in the moon's beam by
; the window. They are lit, not glowing: a mote is only seen where a light
; finds it, so the dark corners stay dark. No collision; the lamp field sits
; above the line from the chair to the copy so no mote drifts over the sheet.

